{"v":1,"book":"Eccl","ch":7,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"A good name is better than precious ointment, And the day of death, than the day of one’s birth.","tok":[{"t":"A good "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"better","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" than "},{"t":"precious","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"ointment","s":["H8081"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[5]},{"t":", than the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"one’s","s":["H3205"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"birth","s":["H3205"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"It is better to go to the house of mourning Than to go to the house of feasting, Because that is the end of every man, And the living takes it to heart.","tok":[{"t":"It is "},{"t":"better","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"mourning","s":["H0060"],"a":[4]},{"t":" Than to "},{"t":"go","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"feasting","s":["H4960"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Because that is the "},{"t":"end","s":["H5490"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of every man, And the "},{"t":"living","s":["H2416"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"takes","s":["H5414"],"a":[15]},{"t":" it to "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Sorrow is better than laughter, For by the sadness of face the heart is made good.","tok":[{"t":"Sorrow","s":["H3708"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"better","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" than "},{"t":"laughter","s":["H7814"],"a":[2]},{"t":", For by the "},{"t":"sadness","s":["H7455"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[7]},{"t":" is made good."}]},{"n":4,"text":"The heart of the wise is in the house of mourning, But the heart of fools is in the house of mirth.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is in the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"mourning","s":["H0060"],"a":[3]},{"t":", But the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"fools","s":["H3684"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is in the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"mirth","s":["H8057"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"It is better for one to hear the rebuke of a wise man Than for one to hear the song of fools.","tok":[{"t":"It is "},{"t":"better","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for one to "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"rebuke","s":["H1606"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[4]},{"t":" Than for one to "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"song","s":["H7892"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"fools","s":["H3684"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"For as the crackling of thorns under a pot, So is the laughter of fools. This also is vanity.","tok":[{"t":"For as the "},{"t":"crackling","s":["H6963"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"thorns","s":["H5518"],"a":[2]},{"t":" under a "},{"t":"pot","s":["H5518"],"a":[4]},{"t":", So is the "},{"t":"laughter","s":["H7814"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"fools","s":["H3684"],"a":[7]},{"t":". This also is "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Surely oppression makes a wise man mad, And a bribe destroys the heart.","tok":[{"t":"Surely "},{"t":"oppression","s":["H6233"],"a":[1]},{"t":" makes a wise "},{"t":"man","s":["H2450"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mad","s":["H1984"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And a "},{"t":"bribe","s":["H4979"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"destroys","s":["H0006"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Better is the end of a thing than its beginning; Better is patience of spirit than haughtiness of spirit.","tok":[{"t":"Better","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"end","s":["H0319"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"thing","s":["H1697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" than its "},{"t":"beginning","s":["H7225"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Better","s":["H2896"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is patience of "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[6]},{"t":" than haughtiness of "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Do not be quick in your spirit to become angry, For anger rests in the bosom of fools.","tok":[{"t":"Do not be quick in your "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to become "},{"t":"angry","s":["H3707"],"a":[3]},{"t":", For "},{"t":"anger","s":["H3708"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rests","s":["H5117"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"bosom","s":["H2436"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"fools","s":["H3684"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Do not say, How is it that the former days were better than these? For it is not from wisdom that you ask this.","tok":[{"t":"Do not "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":", How is it that the "},{"t":"former","s":["H7223"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[4]},{"t":" were "},{"t":"better","s":["H2896"],"a":[7]},{"t":" than these? For it is not from wisdom that you ask this."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Wisdom is as good as an inheritance, And an advantage to those who see the sun.","tok":[{"t":"Wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is as "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" as an "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And an advantage to those who "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"sun","s":["H8121"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"For wisdom is a defense, as money is a defense; But the advantage of knowledge is that wisdom preserves the life of those who have it.","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is a "},{"t":"defense","s":["H6738"],"a":[1]},{"t":", as "},{"t":"money","s":["H3701"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is a defense; But the advantage of "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[6]},{"t":" is that "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[7]},{"t":" preserves the "},{"t":"life","s":["H2421"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of those who "},{"t":"have","s":["H1167"],"a":[9]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Consider the work of God, For who can straighten what He has made crooked?","tok":[{"t":"Consider","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":", For who "},{"t":"can","s":["H3201"],"a":[6]},{"t":" straighten what He has made "},{"t":"crooked","s":["H5791"],"a":[10]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":14,"text":"In the day of prosperity be joyful, And in the day of adversity consider. God has made the one as well as the other, So that man may not find out anything about what is after him.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"prosperity","s":["H2896"],"a":[1]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"joyful","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And in the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"adversity","s":["H7451"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"consider","s":["H7200"],"a":[6]},{"t":". "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[13]},{"t":" has made the one as well as the other, So that "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[18]},{"t":" may not "},{"t":"find","s":["H4672"],"a":[17]},{"t":" out anything about what is "},{"t":"after","s":["H0310"],"a":[19]},{"t":" him."}]},{"n":15,"text":"I have seen everything in my days of vanity: There is a righteous man who perishes in his righteousness, and there is a wicked man who prolongs his life in his wickedness.","tok":[{"t":"I have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" everything in my "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"vanity","s":["H1892"],"a":[4]},{"t":": There "},{"t":"is","s":["H3426"],"a":[5]},{"t":" a righteous man who "},{"t":"perishes","s":["H0006"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[8]},{"t":", and there is a "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[10]},{"t":" man who "},{"t":"prolongs","s":["H0748"],"a":[11]},{"t":" his life in his "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H7451"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Do not be overly righteous, and do not be overly wise; why should you destroy yourself?","tok":[{"t":"Do not be overly "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"do","s":["H7235"],"a":[3]},{"t":" not be "},{"t":"overly","s":["H3148"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2449"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; why should you "},{"t":"destroy","s":["H8074"],"a":[8]},{"t":" yourself?"}]},{"n":17,"text":"Do not be overly wicked, and do not be a fool; why should you die when it is not your time?","tok":[{"t":"Do not be overly "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7561"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and do not be a fool; why should you "},{"t":"die","s":["H4191"],"a":[7]},{"t":" when it is not your "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[9]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":18,"text":"It is better for you to take hold of the one without letting go of the other, for he who fears God will come out of it with them all.","tok":[{"t":"It is better for you to take "},{"t":"hold","s":["H0270"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of the one without letting go of the other, for he who "},{"t":"fears","s":["H3373"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[12]},{"t":" will come out of it with them all."}]},{"n":19,"text":"Wisdom strengthens the wise man more than ten rulers who are in a city.","tok":[{"t":"Wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"strengthens","s":["H5810"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[2]},{"t":" man more than "},{"t":"ten","s":["H6235"],"a":[3]},{"t":" rulers who are in a "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":20,"text":"Surely there is not a righteous man on the earth who does good and does not sin.","tok":[{"t":"Surely there is not a righteous "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[1]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"does","s":["H6213"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and does not sin."}]},{"n":21,"text":"Also, do not give heed to all words spoken, lest you hear your servant cursing you.","tok":[{"t":"Also, do not give "},{"t":"heed","s":["H3820"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to all "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[4]},{"t":", lest you "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[10]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"servant","s":["H5650"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cursing","s":["H7043"],"a":[13]},{"t":" you."}]},{"n":22,"text":"For your heart knows that many times you yourself have cursed others also.","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"your","s":["H6471"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[4]},{"t":" that many times you yourself have "},{"t":"cursed","s":["H7043"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"others","s":["H0312"],"a":[10]},{"t":" also."}]},{"n":23,"text":"All this I have tested by wisdom; I said, I will be wise; but it was far from me.","tok":[{"t":"All "},{"t":"this","s":["H2090"],"a":[1]},{"t":" I have tested by "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":", I will be "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2449"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; but it was "},{"t":"far","s":["H7350"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from me."}]},{"n":24,"text":"That which is, is far off, and deep, very deep; who can find it out?","tok":[{"t":"That which is, is far "},{"t":"off","s":["H7350"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and deep, very "},{"t":"deep","s":["H6013"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; who can find it "},{"t":"out","s":["H4672"],"a":[6]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":25,"text":"I turned and my heart was set to know and to search and seek out wisdom and the sum of things, and to know that wickedness is folly and that foolishness is madness.","tok":[{"t":"I turned and my "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":" was set to "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and to "},{"t":"search","s":["H8446"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and seek "},{"t":"out","s":["H1245"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and the sum of things, and to "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[8]},{"t":" that "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H7562"],"a":[9]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"folly","s":["H3689"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and that "},{"t":"foolishness","s":["H5531"],"a":[11]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"madness","s":["H1947"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":26,"text":"And I found more bitter than death the woman whose heart is traps and snares, whose hands are fetters. One who is well pleasing to God escapes from her, but the sinner is taken by her.","tok":[{"t":"And I found more "},{"t":"bitter","s":["H4751"],"a":[2]},{"t":" than "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"woman","s":["H0802"],"a":[5]},{"t":" whose "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[10]},{"t":" is traps and "},{"t":"snares","s":["H4685"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"whose","s":["H2764"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[12]},{"t":" are fetters. One who is well "},{"t":"pleasing","s":["H2896"],"a":[13]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"escapes","s":["H4422"],"a":[16]},{"t":" from her, but the "},{"t":"sinner","s":["H2398"],"a":[18]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"taken","s":["H3920"],"a":[19]},{"t":" by her."}]},{"n":27,"text":"See, this is what I have found, says the Preacher, adding one thing to another to find the sum,","tok":[{"t":"See, this is what I have "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Preacher","s":["H6953"],"a":[4]},{"t":", adding "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[5]},{"t":" thing to another to find the sum,"}]},{"n":28,"text":"Which my soul is still seeking but has not found. One man among a thousand I have found, but a woman among all these I have not found.","tok":[{"t":"Which my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is still "},{"t":"seeking","s":["H1245"],"a":[2]},{"t":" but has not found. "},{"t":"One","s":["H0259"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[6]},{"t":" among a "},{"t":"thousand","s":["H0505"],"a":[8]},{"t":" I have "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[9]},{"t":", but a "},{"t":"woman","s":["H0802"],"a":[10]},{"t":" among all these I have not "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":29,"text":"See, this alone have I found, that God made man upright, but they have sought out many schemes.","tok":[{"t":"See, this alone have I "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[3]},{"t":", that "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"man","s":["H0120"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[9]},{"t":", but they have sought "},{"t":"out","s":["H1245"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"schemes","s":["H2810"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]}]}
